# MODE CERTIFICATE: maximum_relative_halfwidth 1e-7, the row this card's cut was solved with: at origin's default 1e-8 a scan of the solve on these ratios was refused (FS-MODAL-HALFWIDTH-EXCEEDED, a relative half-width of 3.73e-8 in window 3 of 12). It sets no sound.
